  "description": "A girl just can't catch a break!\n\nHaving wished to live an unconventional life, Emily gets accepted into her dream school, where nobles and commoners are equals. But when she meets her fellow students and gets roped into a crazy love triangle with a prince on her first day, she begins to realize her wish may have already come true.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
